My strong suspicion is that your model structure uses what we call stochastic indexing -- that is, one (or more) stochastic model nodes is being indexed using another (discrete) stochastic quantity.  Unfortunately, that functionality is not yet supported in NIMBLE, although it is certainly on our to-do list.  As Perry said, you're welcomed to send your model description, data, etc, to this list, or confidentially to the developers list (nimble...@gmail.com), for a full prognosis.

Cheers,
Daniel

